WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.802
Shelfmark keeps every link you save in one place.

2
00:00:01.802 --> 00:00:05.233
Open the demo: the tab bar keeps everything in reach.

3
00:00:05.233 --> 00:00:11.344
Paste a link: the preview fills in by itself.

4
00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:17.586
Pick a folder and a tag, then save.

5
00:00:17.586 --> 00:00:34.002
A pile of links? Paste them all at once.

6
00:00:34.002 --> 00:00:40.472
Folders get a colour and an icon…

7
00:00:40.472 --> 00:00:44.540
…and the ones you use most stay pinned on top.

8
00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:52.002
A tag gathers its links from every folder.

9
00:00:52.002 --> 00:00:55.741
Need it again? Tap Search.

10
00:00:55.741 --> 00:00:59.979
Saved views keep the filters you use often.

11
00:00:59.979 --> 00:01:03.633
Star the keepers; Favorites gathers them.

12
00:01:03.633 --> 00:01:07.600
Recently opened brings back what you read.

13
00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:19.002
Deleted by mistake? Trash keeps it for 30 days.

14
00:01:19.002 --> 00:01:27.867
Select several links and act on all of them at once.

15
00:01:27.867 --> 00:01:39.001
Or move one link from its menu.

16
00:01:39.001 --> 00:01:44.733
Light, dark, or your own accent colour.

17
00:01:44.733 --> 00:01:48.958
In six languages.

18
00:01:48.958 --> 00:01:51.920
Export everything, any time.

19
00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:59.433
And tell us what you think: we read every message.

20
00:01:59.433 --> 00:02:06.003
On the phone, share a link from any app straight to Shelfmark.

21
00:02:06.003 --> 00:02:09.957
With an account, share a folder as a public collection.

22
00:02:09.957 --> 00:02:14.090
Turn the public link on and copy it.

23
00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:19.547
Anyone with the link sees a read-only page, no account needed.

24
00:02:19.547 --> 00:02:22.550
Shelfmark. Every link, back within reach.
